---
// Verbatim Authentic Copy, Exact Nomenclature & Embedded Media
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import KhaoSokMap from '../../components/KhaoSokMap.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Khao Sok Map & Directions: Getting Here from Phuket, Krabi, and Surat Thani"
  description="Khao Sok map & directions. Easily travel to Khao Sok from Bangkok, Phuket, Krabi, or Surat Thani. View the Khao Sok national park map."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/directions-11.jpg"
  heroTitle="Khao Sok Map & Directions"
  heroSubtitle="Getting Here from Bangkok, Phuket, Krabi, Koh Samui & Surat Thani"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: "The Resort", href: "/khao-sok-resort/" },
    { label: "Getting Here", href: "/khao-sok-map-directions/" },
  ]}
>
  <article class="max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-12">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-14 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Verified Header Badge -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[#2e6b45] text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#2e6b45] animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>The Resort · Arrival & Transportation Guide</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#ba9038] tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold">GPS: 8.911049, 98.541834</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Top Primary Interactive Map: Southern Thailand Regional Map (Exact Authentic Setup) -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-3">
          <div>
            <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-6 bg-[#2e6b45] rounded-full inline-block"></span>
              <span>Southern Thailand Regional Map</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-[#2e5339] font-light mt-1">
              Showing Khao Sok Riverside Cottages, surrounding airports, and ferry piers
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=8.911049,98.541834"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#ba9038] hover:bg-[#d8b257] text-[#12281b] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold transition-all shadow-md shrink-0"
          >
            <span>Directions on Google Maps</span>
            <span>↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <KhaoSokMap
          mapId="regional-transport-map"
          type="regional"
          height="500px"
          title="Southern Thailand Regional Overview"
          subtitle="Airports · Ferry Piers · Resort Coordinates"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Verbatim Authentic Introduction -->
      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-4xl">
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          This Khao Sok Map and directions page will help you get from Bangkok, Phuket, Krabi, Koh Samui, or Surat Thani to Khao Sok. Getting here with public transport is easy – see below for full details. Call us when you have arrived at the Khao Sok bus stop and we’ll pick you up for free. It takes only 2-3 hours to get from Phuket to Khao Sok or from Krabi to Khao Sok. It’s about the same drive time to Don Sak Pier, the transfer point for ferries from Khao Sok to Koh Samui, Koh Phangan, and Koh Tao. You can book onward tickets at the Khao Sok van station. View the Khao Sok national park map to get an idea of the size and highlights of the lake and park.
        </p>

        <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          If you are traveling using your own transport then our directions will be invaluable. We are ideally located between Southern Thailand’s main travel destinations. Accordingly, we offer private transfers by car or van from anywhere in Southern Thailand. See the Khao Sok map for distances.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section: Private Transfers Table (Verbatim Pricing & Destinations) -->
      <div class="pt-10 border-t border-[#12281b]/10 space-y-6">
        <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-2">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-6 bg-[#2e6b45] rounded-full inline-block"></span>
            <span>Private Transfers – How to get to Khao Sok</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            Often, a private transfer is the easiest and fastest way to reach Khao Sok. Our friendly drivers will be holding a sign with your name on it, ready to take you to Khao Sok. The following table details the prices of how to get to Khao Sok by private vehicle.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 shadow-md bg-white">
          <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-sm sm:text-base">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-[#12281b] text-white font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
                <th class="p-4 border-r border-white/10">Location</th>
                <th class="p-4 border-r border-white/10 text-center w-36">Car Price (THB)</th>
                <th class="p-4 text-center w-36">Van Price (THB)</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-[#12281b]/10 text-[#12281b]">
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#f4efeb] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Surathani Airport or Train Station to Khao Sok</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25] border-r border-[#12281b]/10">฿2,000</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25]">฿2,100</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#f4efeb] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Surathani Town to Khao Sok</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25] border-r border-[#12281b]/10">฿2,300</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25]">฿2,400</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#f4efeb] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Tapee Pier to Khao Sok (Lomprayah Ferry)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25] border-r border-[#12281b]/10">฿2,400</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25]">฿2,500</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#f4efeb] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Don Sak Pier to Khao Sok (Raja or Seatran Ferry)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25] border-r border-[#12281b]/10">฿3,200</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25]">฿3,400</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#f4efeb] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Ao Nang / Krabi to Khao Sok (including Krabi Airport)</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25] border-r border-[#12281b]/10">฿2,900</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25]">฿3,100</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#f4efeb] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Khao Lak to Khao Sok</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25] border-r border-[#12281b]/10">฿1,900</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25]">฿2,000</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#f4efeb] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Phuket Airport to Khao Sok</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25] border-r border-[#12281b]/10">฿2,900</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25]">฿3,100</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#f4efeb] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Phuket Town to Khao Sok</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25] border-r border-[#12281b]/10">฿3,200</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25]">฿3,400</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-[#f4efeb] transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 font-medium">Patong, Kata, Karon, Katu, or Rawai</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25] border-r border-[#12281b]/10">฿3,500</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25]">฿3,700</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-[#ba9038]/10 hover:bg-[#ba9038]/15 transition-colors">
                <td class="p-4 font-semibold text-[#12281b]">Shared pick up from Surathani Airport</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-semibold text-[#8a6b25] border-r border-[#12281b]/10">—</td>
                <td class="p-4 text-center font-mono font-bold text-[#ba9038]">฿250 / person</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <!-- Notes Callout -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white/70 border border-[#12281b]/10 space-y-3">
          <h4 class="font-monumental text-sm text-[#12281b] uppercase tracking-wider">Transfer Notes</h4>
          <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-[#223e2c]">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-[#2e6b45] font-bold">✦</span>
              <span>A van fits 3-10 people. A car fits up to 2 adults and 1 child.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-[#2e6b45] font-bold">✦</span>
              <span>Prices are listed in Thai Baht. A deposit is necessary to confirm pickup, and must be received at least 72 hours before arrival, along with time and location of pick up.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-[#2e6b45] font-bold">✦</span>
              <span>From Koh Samui to Khao Sok, or from nearby islands, you must choose your ferry company, and then book your transfer from their pier.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-[#2e6b45] font-bold">✦</span>
              <span>Please inquire for destinations not listed, we can provide pick up from anywhere in Southern Thailand.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-[#2e6b45] font-bold">✦</span>
              <span>Prices subject to change without notice, please reconfirm by email.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <figure class="my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/directions-11.jpg"
            alt="The road to Khao Sok"
            class="w-full h-80 sm:h-[460px] object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">The road to Khao Sok</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <!-- Section: By Air -->
      <div class="pt-10 border-t border-[#12281b]/10 space-y-4 max-w-4xl">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-6 bg-[#2e6b45] rounded-full inline-block"></span>
          <span>By Air</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg">
          As our Khao Sok map shows, guests can fly into Surat Thani, Phuket, or Krabi airports. The closest airport to Khao Sok is Surat Thani airport. The journey time is about 1.5 hours drive, while Krabi airport is 2 hours away. Be sure to visit our blog for information on the journey from Surat Thani airport to Khao Sok national park. Phuket airport has the most flight options, including many international connections, and is 2.5-3 hours from Khao Sok. Use Skyscanner to find cheap flights to any of these airports. Upon arrival at the airport, we can send a car to pick you up or you can take public transport. Check out our Khao Sok directions to find the way.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section: Public Transport -->
      <div class="pt-10 border-t border-[#12281b]/10 space-y-6 max-w-4xl">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-6 bg-[#2e6b45] rounded-full inline-block"></span>
          <span>Public Transport</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg">
          Phantip Travel is the main public transport provider in the south of Thailand. The Khao Sok Map and information will help you in your travels!
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg">
          When arriving via public transport, get off at the Khao Sok Bus Station (this is also where public vans stop). We have a free shuttle, and our driver is often at the bus station – he will be holding a sign that says Riverside Cottages, along with the names of our sister resort, Coco Hostel.
        </p>

        <!-- Shuttle Contact Box -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#12281b] to-[#1c3d24] text-white border border-[#ba9038]/30 shadow-xl space-y-3">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-[#ba9038] tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold">Free Shuttle Pickup Service</span>
          <p class="text-sm text-emerald-100/90 leading-relaxed">
            If you do not see our driver, please call us, and we will come to pick you up. Our phone numbers are <strong class="text-white">077 395 159</strong>, and <strong class="text-white">+66 910 415 061</strong> (also for WhatsApp). If you don’t have a phone, you can walk across the highway and ask at one of the shops to call Riverside Cottages.
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="tel:+6677395159" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#ba9038] text-[#12281b] font-mono text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-wider hover:bg-[#d8b257] transition-all">
              Call 077 395 159
            </a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/66910415061" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/20 text-white font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all">
              WhatsApp +66 910 415 061
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <figure class="my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/directions-3.jpg"
            alt="Girls in a pickup"
            class="w-full h-80 sm:h-[460px] object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Girls in a pickup</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c] text-sm">
          Follow these links for detailed information on travel options to Khao Sok:
        </p>

        <!-- Route Cards Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-2">
          {[
            ['Bangkok to Khao Sok', '/train-bangkok-khao-sok/'],
            ['Surat Thani to Khao Sok', '/get-surat-thani-airport-khao-sok/'],
            ['Koh Samui to Khao Sok', '/khao-sok-map-directions/'],
            ['Phuket to Khao Sok', '/phuket-to-khao-sok/'],
            ['Krabi to Khao Sok', '/krabi-to-khao-sok/'],
            ['Leaving Khao Sok', '/khao-sok-map-directions/'],
          ].map(([label, href]) => (
            <a
              href={href}
              class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#12281b]/10 hover:border-[#ba9038] hover:bg-[#f4efeb] transition-all flex items-center justify-between group shadow-sm"
            >
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#12281b] group-hover:text-[#ba9038] transition-colors">{label}</span>
              <span class="text-[#2e6b45] group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section: Driving on your own to Khao Sok -->
      <div class="pt-10 border-t border-[#12281b]/10 space-y-6">
        <div class="max-w-4xl space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-6 bg-[#2e6b45] rounded-full inline-block"></span>
            <span>Driving on your own to Khao Sok</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg">
            Our GPS location is <strong>8.911049, 98.541834</strong>. See the Khao Sok map below, or <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=8.911049,98.541834" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#2e6b45] hover:text-[#ba9038] underline font-semibold">click here for a Google Map</a>. These Khao Sok directions will make the journey a delight.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Second Interactive Map: Local Approach & Entrance -->
        <KhaoSokMap
          mapId="resort-approach-map"
          type="resort"
          height="420px"
          title="Resort Entrance & Road Approach Map"
          subtitle="02 · Approach Lane from Highway 401"
        />

        <div class="space-y-6 max-w-4xl text-[#223e2c]">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#12281b]/10 shadow-sm space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-display text-lg text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight">
              From the East Coast
            </h4>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              Directions from the East Coast and Surat Thani to Khao Sok: Follow Highway 41 to the intersection with Highway 401 (11 km south of the Surat Thani Airport). Then, head west on the 401, and proceed for 89.3 km. Finally, turn right (north) across from the Riverside Cottages sign and proceed 2.5 km to our resort at the end of the road.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#12281b]/10 shadow-sm space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-display text-lg text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight">
              From the West Coast
            </h4>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              Directions from the West Coast (Phuket, Khao Lak, Ranong). Begin by taking Highway 4 to Highway 401 as indicated on our Khao Sok map. Next, drive west for 36.6 km, where you will see the sign for Khao Sok National Park. Continue on the highway for 2 km. Finally, turn left when you see a Riverside Cottages sign on your right across from our road. To finish, head 2.5 km to the end of the road, where you will find our resort. See the Khao Sok map on Google for more details.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#12281b]/10 shadow-sm space-y-2">
            <h4 class="font-display text-lg text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight">
              Directions from Krabi and Phang Nga
            </h4>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              Start on Highway 4, and then head north on one of two routes: if you prefer a more rural road, take Route 4118, or if you prefer a less curvy and slightly shorter road, take Route 415. Follow either of these routes until they terminate at Highway 401. At this point, take a left on Highway 401 and head west for 42.2km. Finally, turn right across from the Khao Sok Riverside Cottages sign and proceed 2.5 km to our resort.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <figure class="my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/directions-4.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok national park map and sign"
            class="w-full h-80 sm:h-[460px] object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok national park map and sign</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <!-- Section: Leaving our resort -->
      <div class="pt-10 border-t border-[#12281b]/10 space-y-4 max-w-4xl">
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#1b432c] font-semibold tracking-tight">
          Leaving our resort
        </h3>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg">
          We view your onward departure as an extension of your stay with us! For this reason, we’ll make sure that it is an easy, stress-free experience. For example, a private car or van can be arranged with a friendly, English-speaking staff member at our reception desk.
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg">
          Conversely, if you are opting for public transportation, you will find daily shared vans and buses heading toward all major destinations. Our staff are happy to help you navigate the confusing network of bus and minivan schedules. Guests leaving our resort for public transport will be delivered to Khao Sok town via our resort shuttle. As a result, we can ensure punctual arrival at the bus stop, and a smooth departure from town. In other words, you will find your departure as easy and relaxing as your stay with us!
        </p>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#2e5339] text-sm">
          For a deeper dive into Khao Sok browse our blog and check out our FAQs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section: Khao Sok National Park Map (Third Interactive Map with 13 Landmarks) -->
      <div class="pt-10 border-t border-[#12281b]/10 space-y-6">
        <div class="max-w-4xl space-y-2">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-6 bg-[#2e6b45] rounded-full inline-block"></span>
            <span>Khao Sok National Park Map</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg">
            View the Khao Sok national park map to get the lay of the land. You will see that Khao Sok village is very near to the national park HQ but quite a distance from the Rajjaprabha Dam and the Cheow Lan pier. Most accommodations are situated in and around the village.
          </p>
        </div>

        <KhaoSokMap
          mapId="national-park-lake-map"
          type="park"
          height="520px"
          title="Khao Sok National Park & Cheow Lan Lake Map"
          subtitle="03 · 13 Key Natural Landmarks & Pier Points"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Authentic Field Photo Gallery (Optimal Full-Resolution) -->
      <div class="mt-16 pt-10 border-t border-[#12281b]/15 space-y-8">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#12281b] font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-6 bg-[#2e6b45] rounded-full inline-block"></span>
            <span>Original Photography & Visual Field Gallery</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#2e6b45] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">
            Authentic full-resolution imagery from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
          {[
            ['The last mile', '/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/directions-5.jpg'],
            ['Enjoying the ride', '/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/directions-6.jpg'],
